1
00:00:00,179 --> 00:00:02,049
(Sheldon:)They're perfect.

2
00:00:03,482 --> 00:00:06,312
(Sheldon:)It tastes like her hugs.

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,350
(Amy:)Merry Christmas, Sheldon.

4
00:00:12,024 --> 00:00:14,424
(Sheldon:)I can't believe this.

5
00:00:14,426 --> 00:00:18,096
(Sheldon:)You're happy, I'm happy.

6
00:00:18,097 --> 00:00:20,367
(Sheldon:)Well, maybe a holiday that's
all about giving isn't so...

7
00:00:20,365 --> 00:00:22,895
Get your hand out of that box!

8
00:00:28,841 --> 00:00:29,911
(Leonard:)Okay.

9
00:00:29,908 --> 00:00:33,708
(Amy:)The next game is called
Hot Boiled Beans.

10
00:00:35,647 --> 00:00:38,217
(Sheldon:)Of course it is.

11
00:00:38,217 --> 00:00:40,347
(Amy:)One person is sent
out of the room

12
00:00:40,352 --> 00:00:42,682
(Amy:)while the others
hide a small item.

13
00:00:42,688 --> 00:00:43,888
(Amy:)Then they invite

14
00:00:43,889 --> 00:00:45,819
(Amy:)the first person back by saying,

15
00:00:45,824 --> 00:00:48,054
(chanting): "Hot boiled beans
and bacon for supper,

16
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:52,660
hurry up before it gets cold."

17
00:00:53,932 --> 00:00:56,462
(Raj:)If you people think this is
better than Tom Hanks-giving,

18
00:00:56,468 --> 00:00:58,538
(Raj:)you're all crazy.

